dungeons. Be on your guard!Visual & Quality of Life UpdatesDung","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-10-13T16:15:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1813041031342375","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3587900-1811138915453983","game_id":"steam-3587900","kind":"announcement","title":"0.6.15-demo","summary":"Greetings, Spellweavers! The newest 0.6.15-demo update features a lot of new things. To name a few:* New trap rooms! Projectile maze, Laser Wall, Spinning Laser, Minefield and more!* New secret trap and enemy challenge rooms - complete them and earn their rewards!* Improved dungeon generation - corridors and more randomness await.* New Aspects - including Drone aspects that follow you around and shoot lasers!* Numerous bug- and balancing fixes.* Extra special rooms.* Visual upgrades and de-clutt","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-09-20T09:55:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1811138915453983","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3587900-1805431065495879","game_id":"steam-3587900","kind":"announcement","title":"spellloom - 0.6.5-demo","summary":"Greetings, Spellweavers,Version 0.6.5-demo is now live! This update introduces a major new gameplay system, a formidable new boss, a dazzling array of laser-based spells, and several quality-of-life improvements based on your feedback. New Content & FeaturesNew Perk System - Spices: A new mysterious protagonist has been added to the dungeons!Find him to acquire \"Spices,\" which are powerful perks that can provide anything from minor bonuses to game-altering effects. There are currently 20 unique ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-07-22T11:50:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1805431065495879","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3587900-1800991756405087","game_id":"steam-3587900","kind":"announcement","title":"spellloom - v.0.6.0-demo","summary":"Greetings, Spellweavers! Version 0.6.0-demo is now live! This update brings significant changes to the spell system for deeper, more interesting spell-crafting. You’ll also find new challenges, dungeon-progression tweaks, visibility improvements, and balance adjustments based on your feedback. Important Note: The number of Aspects available at the start of a new demo run has been increased to 37! The total pool that can be permanently unlocked in this demo is now 58, giving you even more variety","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-06-01T10:49:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1800991756405087","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3587900-1799817379463640","game_id":"steam-3587900","kind":"announcement","title":"spellloom 0.5.0-demo","summary":"spellloom v0.5.0-demo Patch Notes - The Guardian, The Weaver, and Unlocks! Greetings, Spellweavers! The loom has been working overtime! This update introduces a formidable new challenge, revamps boss rewards, and implements a brand new system for unlocking Essences and Aspects permanently across your runs. New Content & Features * New Boss Encounter: The Spectral Weaver! A new adversary awaits in the dungeon, featuring multiple phases, unique attack patterns, and dynamic movement. Prepare for a ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-05-15T09:37:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1799817379463640","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3587900-1797820624456546","game_id":"steam-3587900","kind":"update","title":"spellloom v0.4.0‑demo - Patch Notes","summary":"Greetings, Spellweavers! I’ve spent the last month weaving code, and this new update is full of new content - new rooms, mechanics, optimizations and quality‑of‑life tweaks. New Content Survival Room - Hold out against enemy waves and survive until the time runs out. Invocaris Miniboss Room - Pray to the Ancients for rewards; certain upgrade rooms are locked behind this encounter. Augumentis (Aspect Upgrade Room) - Add special modifiers to Aspects. Modulora (Essence Upgrade Room) - Upgrade your ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-04-24T10:33:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1797820624456546","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3587900-1795917897399654","game_id":"steam-3587900","kind":"update","title":"Update for the demo version","summary":"Hello everybody! Thanks for playing the demo and giving feedback - on Discord, YouTube and Steam! In the newest demo version you will find numerous QoL upgrades, new Aspects and new enemies. Just to name a few: Try it out and let let me know what you think. Happy Spellweaving!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-04-05T20:03:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1795917897399654","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3587900-1794830910911472","game_id":"steam-3587900","kind":"announcement","title":"spellloom demo now available!","summary":"Greetings, Spellweavers! After mor